1
00:00:02,460 --> 00:00:06,010
Previously:
- Who says that in the middle of sex?

2
00:00:06,214 --> 00:00:08,254
I don't know.
It was the heat of the moment.

3
00:00:08,466 --> 00:00:11,176
No, the heat of the moment is,
"Oh, yeah, just like that."

4
00:00:11,386 --> 00:00:14,136
Not, "Will you marry me?"

5
00:00:15,849 --> 00:00:19,519
NASA really wants my telescope up
on the Space Station...

6
00:00:19,728 --> 00:00:22,568
...so they're putting me
on an earlier launch.

7
00:00:22,856 --> 00:00:25,856
- When?
- A week from Friday.

8
00:00:26,067 --> 00:00:28,657
What? But we're getting married
that Sunday.

9
00:00:28,862 --> 00:00:33,822
You're right. I can't go to space.
l have to get married.

10
00:00:34,034 --> 00:00:37,824
No one can say that's not a good reason.
I'll call them back.

11
00:00:38,580 --> 00:00:41,710
- Have the wedding when you get back.
- Your dad's gonna be furious.

12
00:00:41,916 --> 00:00:45,506
There's no way he's gonna let us
postpone this wedding. Well, we tried.

13
00:00:46,838 --> 00:00:50,378
I'll talk to him.
He won't say no to his little girl.

14
00:00:50,592 --> 00:00:54,432
No, l... I should talk to him,
you know, man-to-man.

15
00:00:54,929 --> 00:01:00,059
All right, look, I'm gonna level with you.
I'm terrified about going into space.

16
00:01:00,268 --> 00:01:03,108
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)You know,
what if I don't make it back?

